            "response": "written",
            "prompt": "Write a structured account of the familiar shared decision for an absent member. Include the reason and a conclusion supported by it.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "Two members proposed today because their partner could attend; another proposed tomorrow because a different partner could attend. The group finally agreed on tomorrow and agreed to explain the discussion personally to the absent member. Write that decision and reason; one member still prefers today.\nFamiliar meanings available: member; companion; pal; thus; consequently; but; however.",
            "contextLanguage": "en",
            "label": "Write your own message",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed writing practice",
